{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56870","headline":"杭州民诵刺史房孺复（题拟） · 佚名","name":"杭州民诵刺史房孺复（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虽有饥馑，必有丰年。\n大盗既去，我公来臻。\n（见李观《李元菜肴文集》卷四《上杭州房使君书》引）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56870.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56870","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}